`verilator_config
// Configuration of the Verilator flow (scripts/sim.py).
//
// The register model's backdoor (peek/poke, uvm_hdl_* through VPI) reaches the
// RTL variables of the register block, so they must stay visible at run time.
// Making the whole design public (--public-flat-rw) also exposes the UVM
// classes and does not compile, so only the DUT's register block is listed.
public_flat_rw -module "yapp_hbus_regs" -var "*"
